{"server":"cn","storyId":"act15d5_level_act15d5_st02","groupId":"act15d5","stageId":null,"title":"荒野路漫漫","storyCode":"","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act15d5/level_act15d5_st02.txt","sourceHash":"893ea7278ecb9e7155e8708f198efc45a43ef7e7abc6f34c7148f4e9abfb381a","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"叙拉古中西部的荒野上，三个从城中逃出来的青年，驾驶着偷来的车，开始了他们全新的旅途。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"漫无边际的荒野上，一名红发沃尔珀男性正蹲在地上聚精会神地看着什么。\n在他身后不远处有一辆车，一名白发鲁珀男性和一名黑发菲林正在检查车辆。\n三人看起来是同行者，而他们的车似乎出了故障。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奥斯塔，快过来。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你来看这些虫子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"它们排成一排走得好有规律啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"而且它们的队伍拉得还挺长的，让我看看它们打算去哪里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......你看起来精神了不少。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"没错，我现在感觉我好多了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"但是，我不太相信你对自己身体的判断。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你是我老妈吗！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你半小时前还咳血了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，但是我现在没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，糟了，光顾着跟你说话，虫子爬走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"算了，我去继续修车了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哦，车子什么问题你们查出来没有啊，要不要我来帮忙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"管道出了一些故障，发动机发动不起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我和布洛卡应付得来，你别到处乱跑就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"就算你让我到处乱跑，这边什么都没有，我也跑不到哪儿去啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着一阵轰鸣声，引擎终于重新发动了起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......布洛卡，去把贾维叫回来吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，布洛卡，来比赛谁尿得比较远啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......我现在尿不出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"别在这种时候正经回答他，布洛卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"真是可惜，现在可是适合尿尿的天气！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得除了极寒的地方，大概也没有不适合尿......解手的天气。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"这你就不懂了，奥斯塔，这种事讲究一个感觉！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，完美的弧线——*叙拉古常用语*！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"忽然刮来一阵大风把我完美的弧线吹到我的鞋上了！啧，真倒霉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......别闹了，该出发了，如果我们不能在日落前找到一个聚集地，今天就要在荒野上睡觉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野不好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"这么说起来，我还没有露营过呢！我们今天来露营吧！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"荒野上很危险，而且从根本上来说，这辆偷来的车上并没有露营装备，我们只能睡在车上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，燃料也是一个问题。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"切，真是不上道的车主。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得一般城里的车主也不会在车上准备露营的东西，更不会准备额外的燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"但是准备一下又没有坏处，谁知道自己的车哪天会不会被人借走开去露营呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你会吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那就闭嘴准备出发了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哦。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"要出发了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我来开吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"什么，该我了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你好好休息。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，我最近发现你越来越像老妈了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，布洛卡，你有没有这么觉得？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"有一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"因为你们两个得了矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我听说良好的生活习惯对抑制病情有帮助，你每天应该早点睡，贾维。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"天呐，你知道吗，奥斯塔，我妈都没有对我说过这句话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"*叙拉古问候语*闭嘴。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"奥斯塔说着发动了引擎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"听什么歌好呢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，这辆车的车主听的歌还不少......啊哈，这个封面不错，就这首吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"随着贾维将翻找出的唱片塞入车载音响中，欢快的音乐从音响中传出——\n“♪周六我想骑我的驮兽”\n“♪像个巨星一样带着礼物出现在你的家门口”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨声）还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。那么，继续前进吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，奥斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我们现在在往哪儿开？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"这个问题我在出发时应该就告诉过你答案。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"忘了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得你可能只是根本没有听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我们溜出来的时候，我顺手拿了一张地图，我们现在姑且在往最近的拉克玛蒂瓦城开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我记得那边和我们家族的势力不是很对付，运气好的话，我们可以加入他们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不行也至少有个地方可以落脚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，我以前听说叙拉古的西边有个好像很古怪的镇子，里面经常闹鬼，我们去那儿看看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"别做梦了，我们根本不知道它在哪儿，而且说不定根本就是别人编的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"那要不然我们去其他十二家族在的城市看看？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，虽然说西西里联盟也是十三家族之一，但是整天自己搞来搞去，什么联盟，哈！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟西西里联盟不像那些真正的大家族一样有组织，是由许多大小家族组成的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那些大家族的人可不会在乎我们这些西西里联盟的无名小卒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁，总有一天他们会来求我加入他们的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"反正怀特城暂时是回不去了......不，或许是永远都回不去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，我们把特林家族也惹恼了，怀特已经没有我们的立足之地了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，毕竟捅了那么大的篓子，我还挺想看看老大的，啊呸、林顿的那张丑脸现在是什么表情的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，事到如今后悔也迟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"后悔......倒是不至于，毕竟林顿确实是个混账。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"把我们卖了还想让我们帮他数钱，不可能的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。我也不后悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，别想了，有些家族不还把第一次出狱当成一些新成员真正加入家族的仪式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"而昨天，我们反抗了我们原本的家族，并从那座城市里逃了出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"所以现在我宣布，你们都是我贾维家族真正的成员了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，你就是家族首席军师了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，你就是家族首席打手了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪但当你对着地板笑的时候不难察觉——”\n“♪你不知道——”\n“♪你不知道你很丑！”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，开了这么久，一个人都没见到啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"城外除了少数的一些聚集地和村落，本来就几乎不会有行人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"因为有些在城市里混不下去的家族会在荒野上肆虐，我以前跟过几次家族里的商队，每次都会做好充足的准备。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"像我们现在这样完全没有准备就跑到荒野上的人，一般只有死路一条。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，死路一条，这个说法我喜欢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不过也是，我在修车厂的时候也见过那些要出去的家伙都会来准备很多东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，要是逃出来的时候能多带点吃的就好了。奥斯塔——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"后备箱里那些吃的你想都别想，那是我们应急用的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"能逃出来已经不错了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"要不是昨晚正好是曼德尔守门，我们现在大概已经被蒙上眼绑在椅子上坐在小黑屋里了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，下次这种时候记得提醒我多带点吃的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......算了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，真没劲啊，明明有这么广阔的土地却不能用起来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你看这边，我们就在这里建一个这————么大的修车厂，然后就在里面搞改装车，那该有多爽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"为了躲避天灾啊，我们无法抵抗天灾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，天灾，矿石病，这片大地上就没什么好事啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，就没有什么有趣的事情吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......你要看吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚刚看完的书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"讲什么的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"一对恋人因为所属家族之间的矛盾而最终被拆散的小说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"......结局很感人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"算了。你怎么还带了这样的书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"因为奥斯塔说路上会很无聊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，布洛卡，我之前就挺好奇的，你很喜欢看这些吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"也没有很喜欢，只是空闲的时候看看，还不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧。哎，说到这个，奥斯塔，你有没有交过女朋友？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡你呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"没有。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，我也没有。不知道谈恋爱有什么意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奥斯塔，你该不会也喜欢看这些书吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我更喜欢看一些有关政治和历史的书。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，不该问你的，我听到这两个字就想睡了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪她在一支维多利亚乐队里吹口琴。”\n“♪她却爱上了一个哥伦比亚男人。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，来点什么刺激的事吧——嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奥斯塔，看那边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那是......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"求求你们，我上有老母，下有孩子......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滚开，老子也上有老下有小。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"乖乖闭嘴，惹老子不高兴了老子在你身上开几个口子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"呜呜......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奥斯塔，布洛卡，我有一个想法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不要告诉我你想加入他们一起抢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？我是说我们把这帮强盗干掉，然后问这群商人要点物资什么的，怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，不过你这个提议也不错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不，还是用你的计划吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"真的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"真的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......他们要是不给，我们再抢就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"好啊！那就，全速前进，把那个蠢货撞飞吧！布洛卡，准备打架了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"喂，看那边！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"什么？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，给我倒！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）我来给你们创造机会，你们趁机......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"（小声）好，好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，布洛卡，你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我尽力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"说什么悄悄话呢！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"滚！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，还挺扎手，过来，一起拖住他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗C","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"哼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗B","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小白脸，哪里走！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"趁现在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"商人","speakerId":"avg_npc_006","isRemote":false,"text":"好，好！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在奥斯塔有意的引导下，强盗们一时间忽略了商人的存在，而商人则在奥斯塔的提醒下抓住这个空当，跳上车。\n而后，随着一阵轰鸣声，车子绝尘而去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"*叙拉古问候语*，你们三个崽子！！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，那我们的物资怎么办？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"活下来再说！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"趁着商人吸引了强盗们的时间，奥斯塔也跳上了他们的车并发动了引擎。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维，上车！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"噢！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不等贾维反应，奥斯塔先一步发动了车辆冲入强盗阵中。\n不过贾维对此早已习惯，闪过两人后，趁着车辆尚未加速，抓住门把翻身入内。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗A","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"别想跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"来了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"布洛卡猛地一挥手中钻头逼退身边的强盗，并在奥斯塔驾驶的车辆驶经身边时翻身进入车内。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"抓稳了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啧，别让他们跑了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虽然强盗们想要停下三人的车，不过已经发动的车辆并没有那么容易停下。最终，三人组的车顺利冲出了强盗们的包围，向着地平线驶去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"还愣着干什么？！你、你、还有你，你们去追那个商人，剩下的都去追那三个崽子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗头领","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"今天他们必须死在这片荒野上不可！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"强盗们","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是！"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哇哦，奥斯塔，快看，他们追上来了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道！系好安全带，我要加速了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪举起你的手 移到腹部”\n“♪不要失去你的呼吸 用力去跳”\n“♪把自己融入到人群中 一切才刚开始”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"narration","text":"即使奥斯塔把车速提到极限，强盗们也依然紧咬不放。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"真是群不死心的家伙，哈——咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维，别把头探出去看他们了，关上窗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你——说——什——么？风太大我没听见！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，把他拉回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳咳——干什么干什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔让你不要探出头去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维你怎么了，忽然咳嗽？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道，大概是因为风灌进嘴巴了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"最好是这样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我有一个好消息和一个坏消息，你们要听哪个？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"坏消息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"燃料快没了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那好消息呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"好消息是，看起来在燃料见底前，我们可以把他们甩开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嚯，在这里能看到移动城市的墙壁了啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，那里应该就是拉克玛蒂瓦城了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，看起来真不错，比我们怀特气派——咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"老实说，贾维，你没事吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"没事没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你也来一起推车吧，看着很近，要走的话我觉得可能一天都走不完。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"这车都没燃料了，我们还要它干嘛？走过去还快一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"其实燃料还剩了一点，我打算在接近城市或者他们追上来的时候再用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"而且，这可是我们现在手上最值钱的东西了，你难道想空着手去一座陌生的城市打拼吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"（口哨）好吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"虽然带着满不在乎的表情，不过贾维还是走到车的一角，和另外两人一起推起了车。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奥斯塔，我开个音响听歌可以吧，耗不了多少燃料。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......这个倒是可以。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，哈，让我看看——这次听这个吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪你好，光明，我的老朋友”\n“♪我又想同你谈一谈”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"——啧，一点也不劲爆啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是觉得还挺好听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也觉得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"行吧，既然你们都喜欢那就这个好了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_desert_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，说起来，奥斯塔，你还记得我们怎么认识的嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"当时你还是个修车工，然后把我家族的人打了一顿，我是被派去收拾你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，然后我们两个不打不相识，在那之后成了好朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"呵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"喂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我没事。布洛卡呢，你还记得嘛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，我永远都不会忘，是你们两个救了我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，没错，你这家伙真够憨的，被自己家族卖了都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不过放心，我绝对不会卖了你的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......这么一想，我们认识还真是相当久了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维，你还是去车上休息吧，不要逞强，我和布洛卡来推车就行。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，我可没有逞强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，我们两个应该是一起得矿石病的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我觉得不是，你们只是差不多同时被检查出来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡应该是哪次火并被人用源石制品划伤的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"至于你这家伙，平时根本不注意什么防护措施，什么时候得都不奇怪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"是是是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，奥斯塔，你整天跟我们在一起，你总有一天也会得这个病吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"或许吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不过就算得了我觉得也不是什么坏事就是了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？为啥？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"比看着你们两个难受要好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈，不愧是我的好兄弟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你今天废话真多，还是躺车上好好休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，我决定在我讨厌的东西列表上加上一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"那是什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"那就是矿石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......布洛卡，把贾维搬到车上去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一路上都十分沉默的布洛卡闻言走过去，将贾维直接抱起并放进了车的后座，而后回到原本的位置继续推车。\n而贾维躺在车上，似乎是觉得阳光太过耀眼，他用手臂遮住了双眼。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，因为这个病，我们被林顿那个混账当做弃子一样随手就扔掉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"还害得我呼吸都感觉不太通畅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，等我们以后成为了十三家族的首领，我一定要想办法把这个矿石病解决掉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......嗯，我们到时候就请许多医生专门研究这个病，或者找那些很厉害的医院，给他们钱让他们去研究。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，没错。然后小爷我还要造一家大医院，把那些因为得了病被看不起的家伙全给丢进去然后把他们都治好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"再把看不起他们的人全都收拾一顿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"我也来帮忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，你当然要来帮忙，奥斯塔也要来，别忘了，你们可是我的首席军师和打手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。贾维，别说话了，好好休息吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，奥斯塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......干什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"你觉得死在荒野上怎么样？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"哈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你说什么呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你不是要成为十三家族的首领吗？怎么可以死在这种地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，没错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"但是我刚才仔细想了想，就这么死在荒野上好像也没什么不好的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"再伟大的人死了也要进坟墓的，死在荒野上和死在几百万一张的床上又有什么区别？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"找几块石头，挖个坑，躺进去，然后闭上眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啪——一个人死了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来也没那么坏嘛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，贾维，你到底在说什么？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"我在说，今天的天空，真*叙拉古语气助词*蓝啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"“♪请把我埋在，无边的荒野。”\n“♪啊朋友再见吧，再见吧，再见——”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"或许是蓄电池的容量耗尽，车载音响播放的音乐也戛然而止。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"贾维，贾维？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎么可以死在这种地方？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"布洛卡，上车，我要去找找附近有没有聚集地，最好能找到人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"奥斯塔，他只是睡着了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"......这家伙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，贾维的病情还是不容乐观，我们最好还是能找到一个愿意治疗感染者的医生......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"罗德岛干员","speakerId":"avg_npc_012","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，你们的车好像出了问题，需要帮忙吗？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_canteen"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"给，三人份的刺身。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，终于来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"谢谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"谢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，贾维小哥你们就是那个时候被罗德岛搭救了才加入罗德岛的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"并没有，那个干员代号是直尺，直尺把我们带到了拉克玛蒂瓦的罗德岛办事处，然后请驻扎在那里的医疗干员给贾维做了一些治疗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"啧啧，孑你的手艺真是没得说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢夸奖。我还以为你们就那么加入罗德岛了呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哪能啊，那时我们又不熟，而且为了换药，奥斯塔还把车交出去了，我当时觉得罗德岛还挺坑的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"不过罗德岛的药是挺有效的，对吧，布洛卡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"布洛卡","speakerId":"char_356_broca","isRemote":false,"text":"确实。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"至于我们为什么加入罗德岛，简单来说，就是贾维惹恼了拉克玛蒂瓦里一个家族的老大，我们又被追杀了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，又是直尺救了我们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"然后在他的引荐下，我们干脆就来到了罗德岛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"原来如此。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，说真的，奥斯塔，那可不能怪我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥斯塔","speakerId":"char_346_aosta","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"听起来又是一个新故事了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"嘿，孑老哥你有没有时间，我给你好好说说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"孑","speakerId":"char_272_strong","isRemote":false,"text":"都已经半夜了，明天也没有什么任务，我去拿点我从龙门带来的酒，一边喝一边说吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，那太好了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"贾维","speakerId":"char_349_chiave","isRemote":false,"text":"那天晚上，我和奥斯塔正要去见......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"深夜的食堂中，男人们的故事会还在继续着......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_272_strong","aliases":["孑"]},{"speakerId":"char_346_aosta","aliases":["奥斯塔"]},{"speakerId":"char_349_chiave","aliases":["贾维"]},{"speakerId":"char_356_broca","aliases":["布洛卡"]}]}
